		DisplayName: Jane Wulfrum
		Bestiary: She shoots from behind her husband with whatever Wulfrum weapon she just built.
	}

	CosmicElemental: {
		DisplayName: Cosmic Elemental
		Bestiary: A curious construct, and though its origins are unknown, it has been decidedly proven that the core of its body leads to somewhere not of our world.
	}

