Taming: {
	Tamed: "{0} has been tamed!"
	SupremeCalamitasQuit: Supreme Calamitas can't go on... Now, press Alt+F4.

	Wrestle: {
		Button: Arm Wrestle
		Reveal: Hmph. You keep coming back... Fancy an arm wrestle, youngster? Beat me and maybe my curse will listen to you.
		Title: Arm wrestling the Old Man
		OldMan: Old Man
		You: You
		Help: Click (or Space) when the notch is in the zone; the middle counts double. Escape to give up.
		Won: You win! The curse relents...
		Lost: The Old Man wins.
	}

	OldManGames: {
		ShellTitle: The Old Man's shell game
		ShellWatch: Watch the skull hiding the key...
		ShellChoose: Click the skull hiding the key (or press 1, 2, 3).
		ShellWon: Found it!
		ShellLost: Wrong skull...
		SimonTitle: The Old Man's memory game
		SimonWatch: Watch the order of the lights...
		SimonRepeat: Repeat it: click the tiles (or 1-4, or arrows). {0}/{1}
		SimonWon: Perfect memory!
		SimonLost: Wrong tile...
	}

	Taxes: {
		Button: File Draedon's taxes
		Chat: Draedon hasn't filed his taxes in centuries! Pay me 1 platinum and I'll file them for him... his machines will calm down.
		Paid: Pleasure doing business. Draedon's paperwork is in order.
		Poor: You can't even afford 1 platinum? Pathetic.
		Wait: Not so fast! Draedon's next tax is due in {0} s.
	}

